<$ScrKeepWithNextSplittable>The next cab Tony haled looked as if it was held together with egg cartons, super glue and baking soda. Mercifully, it had no functioning music system, and so Tony enjoyed instead the music of its misfiring engine, its screeching gearbox and an air-conditioner that sounded like it was macerating live chickens in it.\
